We were delighted to spend this time with you.
我们很高兴与您共度这段时间。

00:51:04.540 --> 00:51:05.639
Craig, I love you.
克雷格，我爱你。

00:51:05.639 --> 00:51:06.442
Alec, I love you.
亚历克，我爱你。

00:51:06.442 --> 00:51:07.150
Love you buddy.
